Package: CDALabeller
Title: Label Cell Death Areas in Agroinfiltration Images
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Williams", , "joshuandwilliams@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' app for drawing square bounding boxes around cell
    death areas in agroinfiltration images, recording a treatment and a 0 to 6
    lesion score for each box, and exporting the boxes as a CSV file that
    'AutoCDAScorer' reads. Annotations are autosaved, and each row records the
    annotator, the time the box was drawn, the image's MD5 checksum and the
    app version.
URL: https://github.com/joshuandwilliams/CDALabeller
BugReports: https://github.com/joshuandwilliams/CDALabeller/issues
